  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PDC C Forestry Forecast capacity - PDC-C Forestry Forecast capaci</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PDC C Forestry Forecast capacity</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A PDC cooperation between SLU and Forestry Directorate of Vietnam aiming to build a proactive Vietnamese forest sector in developing and implementing sustainable management of forest and natural resources in line with social, environmental and economic needs of the country and based on modern and multidisciplinary approaches of assessing current and future trends.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ett akt&#xf6;rssamverkansprojekt mellan SLU och Forestry Directorate of Vietnam f&#xf6;r att utveckla och genomf&#xf6;ra en h&#xe5;llbar f&#xf6;rvaltning av skog och naturresurser i enlighet med de sociala, milj&#xf6;m&#xe4;ssiga och ekonomiska behoven i landet baserat p&#xe5; aktuella och multidisciplin&#xe4;ra metoder f&#xf6;r utv&#xe4;rdering av nuvarande och framtida trender.</narrative>
  </description>
